---
description: No API keys or signing assets in git.
globs:
  - "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

# No secrets

- Never commit `.env`, `.p8`, `.p12`, `.mobileprovision`, or keychain passwords.
- Default tests must run without an Apple Developer account.
- If a key appears in a diff, stop and tell the user to rotate. Do not echo it.
